                                            <Run Text="• 捕捉按钮 X/Y：无名小按钮中心屏幕坐标；优先按坐标匹配 UIA 矩形，失败则绝对点击。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• UIA索引：主窗右下无名小按钮按 Left 排序后的索引（0 起），作坐标失败时的兜底定位。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 拖拽箭头：全屏拖出的起点→终点路径，即自动化直线拖拽轨迹（方向与距离）。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 点击后等待ms：点完捕捉按钮后停顿，等视图/手柄出现再拖。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 拖拽步进ms：拖拽路径上每步移动间隔；过大偏慢，过小可能丢步。" />
                                        </TextBlock>
                                    </ToolTip>
                                </Border.ToolTip>
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource ParamHelpIconTextStyle}" />
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Expander.Header>
                    <Border
                        BorderBrush="LightGray"
                        BorderThickness="1,0,1,1"
                        CornerRadius="0,0,5,5">
                        <StackPanel>
                            <CheckBox
                                Margin="10,10,10,0"
                                Content="主流程启用本步骤（EnablePostAlignCaptureDragSteps）"
                                IsChecked="{Binding EnablePostAlignCaptureDragSteps}" />

                            <TextBlock
                                Margin="10,12,10,0"
                                FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                Text="① 无名捕捉按钮（绝对坐标 + UIA 索引兜底）" />
                            <StackPanel Margin="10" Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" Text="当前标定：" />
                                <TextBlock
                                    Margin="8,0,0,0"
                                    VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                    FontFamily="Consolas"
                                    FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                    Text="{Binding PostAlignCaptureButtonDisplayText}" />
                            </StackPanel>
                            <StackPanel Margin="10,0,10,0" Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <hc:TextBox
                                    Width="100"
                                    Margin="0,0,8,0"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Title="X"
                                    hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Left"
                                    IsReadOnly="True">
                                    <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        <Binding Path="PostAlignCaptureButtonX" />
                                    </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                </hc:TextBox>
                                <hc:TextBox
                                    Width="100"
                                    Margin="0,0,8,0"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Title="Y"
                                    hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Left"
                                    IsReadOnly="True">
                                    <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        <Binding Path="PostAlignCaptureButtonY" />
                                    </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                </hc:TextBox>
                                <hc:TextBox
                                    Width="120"
                                    Margin="0,0,8,0"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Title="UIA索引"
                                    hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Left"
                                    ToolTip="主窗右下无名小按钮按 Left 排序后的索引（0 起）；已标定坐标时优先按坐标匹配矩形">
                                    <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        <Binding Path="PostAlignCaptureButtonIndex" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged">
                                            <Binding.ValidationRules>
                                                <hc:RegexRule Type="PInt" />
                                            </Binding.ValidationRules>
                                        </Binding>
                                    </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                </hc:TextBox>
                                <Button
                                    Command="{Binding CalibratePostAlignCaptureButtonCommand}"
                                    Content="标定捕捉按钮"
                                    IsEnabled="{Binding IsEnableSimulationBtn}"
                                    ToolTip="隐藏上位机 → 十字准星对准视口右下角无名按钮中心" />
                            </StackPanel>

                            <TextBlock
                                Margin="10,16,10,0"
                                FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                Text="② 点击按钮后的拖拽箭头（方向与距离）" />
                            <StackPanel Margin="10" Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" Text="当前标定：" />
                                <TextBlock
                                    Margin="8,0,0,0"
                                    VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                    FontFamily="Consolas"
                                    FontSize="12"
                                    Text="{Binding PostAlignDragDisplayText}"
                                    TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                            </StackPanel>
                            <StackPanel Margin="10,0,10,0" Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <Button
                                    Command="{Binding CalibratePostAlignDragArrowCommand}"
                                    Content="标定拖拽箭头"
                                    IsEnabled="{Binding IsEnableSimulationBtn}"
                                    ToolTip="全屏按住左键拖出黄色箭头：起点→终点即自动化拖拽路径" />
                            </StackPanel>

                            <StackPanel Margin="10,8,10,0" Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <hc:TextBox
                                    Width="180"
                                    Margin="0,0,8,0"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Title="点击后等待ms"
                                    hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Left">
                                    <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        <Binding Path="PostAlignClickWaitMs" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged">
                                            <Binding.ValidationRules>
                                                <hc:RegexRule Type="PInt" />
                                            </Binding.ValidationRules>
                                        </Binding>
                                    </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                </hc:TextBox>
                                <hc:TextBox
                                    Width="180"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Title="拖拽步进ms"
                                    hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Left">
                                    <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        <Binding Path="PostAlignDragStepDelayMs" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged">
                                            <Binding.ValidationRules>
                                                <hc:RegexRule Type="PInt" />
                                            </Binding.ValidationRules>
                                        </Binding>
                                    </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                </hc:TextBox>
                            </StackPanel>

                            <TextBlock
                                Margin="10,8,10,10"
                                Foreground="Gray"
                                Text="执行顺序：优先 UIA 定位无名按钮并 Invoke；失败则用标定绝对坐标点击 → 等待 → 按箭头直线拖拽。未标定齐全时主流程跳过本步。"
                                TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                </Expander>

                <Expander Margin="5">
                    <Expander.Header>
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                            <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" Text="切片导出参数" />
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource ParamHelpIconBorderStyle}">
                                <Border.ToolTip>
                                    <ToolTip>
                                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource ParamHelpToolTipTextStyle}">
                                            <Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Text="本组作用" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="对齐完成后按「前/右/上」三视图导出图像堆栈，写入指定目录与切片范围，供下游检测使用。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Text="参数说明" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 切片导出目录：三视图切片输出根目录；内部按命名规则分子目录/文件。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 图像宽度：导出对话框「图像大小-宽」（默认约 3000）。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 导出数量(局部)：非 QJ 文件的切片数量；文件名含 QJ 时运行时改用 QJ 数量。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 导出数量(QJ)：文件名含 QJ 时的切片数量，并同步局部显示。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 导出对话框等待(ms)：Alt+F+T 后等待「保存…」堆栈对话框出现的超时。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 写入超时(ms)：等待「正在写入图像」进度消失的上限；超时则本视图导出失败。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 上/右/前 · 开始/结束(mm)：各 2D 视图切片图范围，写入导出表单对应字段。" />
                                        </TextBlock>
                                    </ToolTip>
                                </Border.ToolTip>
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource ParamHelpIconTextStyle}" />
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Expander.Header>
                    <Border
                        BorderBrush="LightGray"
                        BorderThickness="1,0,1,1"
                        CornerRadius="0,0,5,5">
                        <StackPanel>
                            <StackPanel Margin="10" Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <hc:TextBox
                                    Width="500"
                                    Margin="0,0,10,0"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Necessary="True"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Title="切片导出目录"
                                    hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Left">
                                    <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        <Binding Path="SliceExportFolder" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                    </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                </hc:TextBox>
                                <Button Width="40" Command="{Binding OpenSliceExportFolderCommand}">
                                    <Image Width="18">
                                        <Image.Source>
                                            <DrawingImage>
                                                <DrawingImage.Drawing>
                                                    <DrawingGroup>
                                                        <GeometryDrawing Brush="Black" Geometry="M256,48C141.31,48,48,141.31,48,256s93.31,208,208,208,208-93.31,208-208S370.69,48,256,48Zm96,240H160a16,16,0,0,1,0-32H352a16,16,0,0,1,0,32Z" />
                                                    </DrawingGroup>
                                                </DrawingImage.Drawing>
                                            </DrawingImage>
                                        </Image.Source>
                                    </Image>
                                </Button>
                            </StackPanel>
                            <StackPanel Margin="10" Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <hc:TextBox
                                    Width="245"
                                    Margin="0,0,10,0"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Necessary="True"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Title="图像宽度"
                                    hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Left"
                                    ToolTip="导出对话框「图像大小-宽」，默认 3000">
                                    <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        <Binding Path="SliceExportImageWidth" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged">
                                            <Binding.ValidationRules>
                                                <hc:RegexRule Type="PInt" />
                                            </Binding.ValidationRules>
                                        </Binding>
                                    </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                </hc:TextBox>
                                <hc:TextBox
                                    Width="245"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Necessary="True"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Title="导出数量(局部)"
                                    hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Left"
                                    ToolTip="非 QJ 文件默认 100；QJ 文件运行时自动改为 150">
                                    <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        <Binding Path="SliceExportQuantity" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged">
                                            <Binding.ValidationRules>
                                                <hc:RegexRule Type="PInt" />
                                            </Binding.ValidationRules>
                                        </Binding>
                                    </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                </hc:TextBox>
                            </StackPanel>
                            <StackPanel Margin="10" Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <hc:TextBox
                                    Width="245"
                                    Margin="0,0,10,0"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Title="导出数量(QJ)"
                                    hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Left"
                                    ToolTip="文件名含 QJ 时使用，并同步更新「导出数量(局部)」显示">
                                    <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        <Binding Path="SliceExportQuantityQj" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged">
                                            <Binding.ValidationRules>
                                                <hc:RegexRule Type="PInt" />
                                            </Binding.ValidationRules>
                                        </Binding>
                                    </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                </hc:TextBox>
                                <hc:TextBox
                                    Width="245"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Title="导出对话框等待(ms)"
                                    hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Left">
                                    <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        <Binding Path="SliceExportDialogWaitTime" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged">
                                            <Binding.ValidationRules>
                                                <hc:RegexRule Type="PInt" />
                                            </Binding.ValidationRules>
                                        </Binding>
                                    </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                </hc:TextBox>
                                <hc:TextBox
                                    Width="245"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Title="写入超时(ms)"
                                    hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Left"
                                    ToolTip="等待「请耐心等待.../正在写入图像」进度框消失，默认 60000（1 分钟）">
                                    <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        <Binding Path="SliceExportWriteTimeoutMs" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged">
                                            <Binding.ValidationRules>
                                                <hc:RegexRule Type="PInt" />
                                            </Binding.ValidationRules>
                                        </Binding>
                                    </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                </hc:TextBox>
                            </StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock
                                Margin="10,8,10,0"
                                FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                Text="切片图范围 (mm) — 按视角分别设置" />
                            <StackPanel Margin="10,4,10,0" Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <hc:TextBox
                                    Width="160"
                                    Margin="0,0,8,0"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Title="上·开始"
                                    hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Left"
                                    ToolTip="「上」视图切片范围开始 [mm]">
                                    <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        <Binding Path="SliceRangeTopStartMm" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                    </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                </hc:TextBox>
                                <hc:TextBox
                                    Width="160"
                                    Margin="0,0,16,0"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Title="上·结束"
                                    hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Left"
                                    ToolTip="「上」视图切片范围结束 [mm]">
                                    <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        <Binding Path="SliceRangeTopEndMm" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                    </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                </hc:TextBox>
                                <hc:TextBox
                                    Width="160"
                                    Margin="0,0,8,0"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Title="右·开始"
                                    hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Left"
                                    ToolTip="「右」视图切片范围开始 [mm]">
                                    <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        <Binding Path="SliceRangeRightStartMm" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                    </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                </hc:TextBox>
                                <hc:TextBox
                                    Width="160"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Title="右·结束"
                                    hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Left"
                                    ToolTip="「右」视图切片范围结束 [mm]">
                                    <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        <Binding Path="SliceRangeRightEndMm" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                    </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                </hc:TextBox>
                            </StackPanel>
                            <StackPanel Margin="10,4,10,10" Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <hc:TextBox
                                    Width="160"
                                    Margin="0,0,8,0"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Title="前·开始"
                                    hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Left"
                                    ToolTip="「前」视图切片范围开始 [mm]">
                                    <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        <Binding Path="SliceRangeFrontStartMm" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                    </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                </hc:TextBox>
                                <hc:TextBox
                                    Width="160"
                                    hc:InfoElement.Title="前·结束"
                                    hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Left"
                                    ToolTip="「前」视图切片范围结束 [mm]">
                                    <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        <Binding Path="SliceRangeFrontEndMm" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                    </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                </hc:TextBox>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                </Expander>
                <Expander
                    Margin="5"
                    Visibility="{Binding IsDebugMode, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVis}}">
                    <Expander.Header>
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                            <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" Text="单步测试" />
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource ParamHelpIconBorderStyle}">
                                <Border.ToolTip>
                                    <ToolTip>
                                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource ParamHelpToolTipTextStyle}">
                                            <Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Text="警告" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="本组按钮仅供测试阶段点击，用于单步验证标定与各阶段自动化是否正常。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Text="生产阶段请勿点击。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="生产请使用页面底部「开始流程」跑完整批处理；误点单测可能干扰正在运行的 VG 界面。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Text="按钮说明" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 测试应用渲染预设：仅验证 LUT 预设下拉选择。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 测试直方图灰度调整：需已标定 ROI；截图→换纯绿→峰谷→拖红线。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 测试厚板设置(三象限)：验证前/右/上厚板菜单与对话框。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 测试简单3-2-1对齐：需标定 3D ROI +「上」ROI + 下拉 + 偏移 Edit。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 测试对齐后捕捉拖拽：需标定捕捉按钮与拖拽箭头。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 测试切片导出(三视图)：验证前/右/上堆栈导出。" />
                                        </TextBlock>
                                    </ToolTip>
                                </Border.ToolTip>
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource ParamHelpIconTextStyle}" />
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Expander.Header>
                    <Border
                        BorderBrush="LightGray"
                        BorderThickness="1,0,1,1"
                        CornerRadius="0,0,5,5">
                        <StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock
                                Margin="10,10,10,0"
                                Foreground="#C0392B"
                                Text="仅测试阶段使用，生产阶段请勿点击。"
                                TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                            <WrapPanel Margin="10" Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <Button
                                    Margin="0,0,10,8"
                                    Command="{Binding TestRenderingPresetCommand}"
                                    Content="测试应用渲染预设"
                                    IsEnabled="{Binding IsEnableSimulationBtn}" />
                                <Button
                                    Margin="0,0,10,8"
                                    Command="{Binding TestHistogramGrayScaleCommand}"
                                    Content="测试直方图灰度调整"
                                    IsEnabled="{Binding IsEnableSimulationBtn}"
                                    ToolTip="需已标定 ROI：截图→目标色换纯绿→峰谷→拖红线" />
                                <Button
                                    Margin="0,0,10,8"
                                    Command="{Binding TestThickPlateCommand}"
                                    Content="测试厚板设置(三象限)"
                                    IsEnabled="{Binding IsEnableSimulationBtn}" />
                                <Button
                                    Margin="0,0,10,8"
                                    Command="{Binding TestSimple321AlignmentCommand}"
                                    Content="测试简单3-2-1对齐"
                                    IsEnabled="{Binding IsEnableSimulationBtn}"
                                    ToolTip="需已标定 3D ROI +「上」ROI + 简单对齐下拉 + 三点后偏移Edit" />
                                <Button
                                    Margin="0,0,10,8"
                                    Command="{Binding TestPostAlignCaptureDragCommand}"
                                    Content="测试对齐后捕捉拖拽"
                                    IsEnabled="{Binding IsEnableSimulationBtn}"
                                    ToolTip="需已标定捕捉按钮与拖拽箭头；VG 已打开且处于可对齐后视图操作的状态" />
                                <Button
                                    Margin="0,0,10,8"
                                    Command="{Binding TestSliceExportCommand}"
                                    Content="测试切片导出(三视图)"
                                    IsEnabled="{Binding IsEnableSimulationBtn}" />
                            </WrapPanel>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                </Expander>

                <TextBlock Margin="5" Text="{Binding MessageShower}" TextWrapping="Wrap" />

                <Expander Margin="5">
                    <Expander.Header>
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                            <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" Text="流程日志" />
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource ParamHelpIconBorderStyle}">
                                <Border.ToolTip>
                                    <ToolTip>
                                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource ParamHelpToolTipTextStyle}">
                                            <Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Text="本组作用" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="实时显示主流程/单测的进度与失败原因，便于现场排查导入失败、标定缺失、超时等问题。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Text="说明" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 清除日志：清空本页文本框内容，不影响磁盘日志。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 日志文本：只读；含进程池调度、各阶段进度及 @@IMPORT_FAIL@@ 等标记。" />
                                        </TextBlock>
                                    </ToolTip>
                                </Border.ToolTip>
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource ParamHelpIconTextStyle}" />
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Expander.Header>
                    <Border
                        BorderBrush="LightGray"
                        BorderThickness="1,0,1,1"
                        CornerRadius="0,0,5,5">
                        <StackPanel Margin="10">
                            <Button
                                Width="100"
                                Margin="0,0,0,5"
                                HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                Command="{Binding ClearImportLogCommand}"
                                Content="清除日志" />
                            <TextBox
                                x:Name="ImportLogTextBox"
                                Height="200"
                                FontFamily="Consolas"
                                IsReadOnly="True"
                                Text="{Binding ImportLogText, Mode=OneWay}"
                                TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                </Expander>

                <!-- 主流程入口：底部居中，左右留边距，高度足够完整显示文字 -->
                <Button
                    MinWidth="180"
                    MinHeight="48"
                    Margin="48,20,48,28"
                    Padding="28,12"
                    HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                    VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                    Command="{Binding RunSimulationCommand}"
                    Content="开始流程"
                    FontSize="16"
                    FontWeight="SemiBold"
                    IsEnabled="{Binding IsEnableSimulationBtn}"
                    ToolTip="生产/批量入口：按 CT 体素文件夹排队执行完整自动化流程" />
            </StackPanel>
        </ScrollViewer>
    </Grid>
</Page>
